+        f"- 固定 `lambda(0_0)=lambda(1_0)=1/2`：槽位最大流 `{specified['fixed_half_budget_flow']['max_flow']:.6g}` / 需求 `{specified['fixed_half_budget_flow']['demand']:.6g}`。",
